        "image_url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/975787212954275916/1561257675575140413/image.png?ex=6ad65ac4\u0026is=6ad50944\u0026hm=e755c3ec8a82fd098fbba40eca97f33d808f758eb7231f72c2ea93c6d663dbae\u0026"
      },
      {
        "id": "1561260072422867087",
        "sender": "jukalang",
        "text": "New JukaHub v0.4 is built from scratch and is 10x smaller than v0.3, is 3 seconds faster in startup, features more modular design, removes dependency on old players and instead uses a custom built from scratch player. There are still many features missing, but feel free to send me a message...Chat is back online, and videos play, tools someone work. FTP server has been added, file manager seems to be working...PDF reader and image viewer are built-in",
        "timestamp": "2026-10-18T06:10:08.075Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "1561260468566233128",
        "sender": "jukalang",
        "text": "",
        "timestamp": "2026-10-18T06:11:42.523Z",
        "image_url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/975787212954275916/1561260468268564510/image.png?ex=6ad65d5e\u0026is=6ad50bde\u0026hm=e7f22576680118c5e89bd5fb02886b678623d9c777a3846b95eb6965c695432c\u0026"
      },
      {
        "id": "1561261560544895129",
        "sender": "jukalang",
        "text": "Packages are included and will be used to install latest emulators...",
        "timestamp": "2026-10-18T06:16:02.871Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "1561263890019655751",
        "sender": "jukalang",
        "text": "I am also experimenting with my custom built v0.4 player which should hopefully reduce power consumption and reduce overheating of the device...",
